---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Gareth Griffiths" bodyClass="about-page">
  <main class="page">
    <section class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="about-copy__eyebrow">About</p>
        <p>
          Gareth Griffiths is a multidisciplinary creative specialising in digital work with a strong focus on interactivity. With a background spanning software development and digital art, he has delivered projects involving full‑stack development and modern front‑end technologies. Gareth brings a distinctive combination of technical expertise and creative vision to every project he undertakes.
        </p>
        <p>
          The practice moves between concept, design, and front-end build,
          focusing on composition, pace, and visual systems that stay clean
          while still feeling distinct. Each project is treated as a simple,
          self-contained object with its own balance of structure and play.
        </p>
        <p>
          Current work spans interactive experiences for experimental projects, generative art, and experimental interfaces. The practice is focused on building a portfolio of work that explores the boundaries of web-based creativity, with an emphasis on projects that are engaging, thought-provoking, and visually striking.
        </p>

        <div class="about-links" aria-label="External links">
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gngriffiths/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/gngriffiths"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="about-image">
        <img
          src="/media/gareth-griffiths-profile.jpg"
          alt="Portrait of Gareth Griffiths"
        />
      </figure>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
